'''Archie''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Critter Safari Entrance}} on the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}} and the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}. They introduce the player to {{Item|Safari Essence}} and the Safari Essence Shop.

