== Salvaging ==
'''Archie''' also allows the player to salvage [[Attribute Shards]] obtained from the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} for {{Item|Safari Essence}}. The amount of {{Item|Safari Essence}} the player receives is dependent on its rarity.

